r public buildings.4. Hamlets, more than 400 "small villages" of 1-3ha with a population less than 200 and no monumental architecture or public buildings<br>"Table 6.4. Monte Alban II population hierarchy in Oaxaca and Ejutla."<br>Valley of Oaxaca: Level I: 14492; II: 979-1947; III: 387-727; IV: 180-343; V: 101-161.'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 945, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 832})
